     A**   CHECK SCHEDULE WORK FILE                                 **
     A**                                                            **
     A****************************************************************
     A** REVISIONS:                                                 **
     A**  11/18/96 *** C:107 *** V2000 ***                          **
     A**           1. Version 2 format changes.                     **
     A**                                                            **
     A**  05/16/98 *** C:107 ***                                    **
     A**           ADDED FIELDS TO ACCOMEDATE SHARING FILE WSCKP    **
     A**           WHICH IS THE FILE WC STORES THE NEXT CHECK # IN  **
     A*                                                             **
     A****************************************************************
     A**
     A                                      REF(CREFP)
     A          R PCP01                     TEXT('CHECK SCHEDULE FILE')
     A            CPCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            CPPRDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('PROCESS DATE')
     A            CPCHK#    R               REFFLD(CHK#)
     A                                      COLHDG('STARTING CHECK #')
     A            CPSTA0    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('CHECKS PRINTED')
     A            CPSTA1    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('CHECKS UPDATED')
     A            CPUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            CPPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            CPTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A            CPDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'MAINTAINED')
     A            CPRSTR    R               REFFLD(CHK#)
     A                                      COLHDG('RESTART CHECK #')
     A            CPWAST    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('WASTE CHECKS ?')
      *** BEG ADD *** 5/16/98 *****************************************
     A            CPFND          3  0       COLHDG('FUND' 'NUMBER')
     A            CPFRDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('FROM DATE' 'NOT USED')
     A            CPTODT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('TO DATE' 'NOT USED')
     A            CPACCT    R               REFFLD(DS20)
     A                                      COLHDG('BANK ACCT #')
      *** END ADD *** 5/16/98 *****************************************
